[I] Simplest command line color picker

[T] colorpicker is a small tool for X11 that writes the RGB color value of
[T] the screen pixel at the cursor position to standard output. A left click
[T] prints the pixel color, any other mouse click quits the program.

[U] https://github.com/ym1234/colorpicker

